"""
phase_corrected.py
===================
Corrected full pipeline after fixing the ChestX6 patient_id bug.

Fixes applied:
  1. ChestX6 patient_id: regex-based extraction (N_<num> / E_<num>)
     so each image is its own patient (correct for this dataset).
  2. Class-stratified patient-level splits: Normal and Emphysema
     patients split independently then merged → both classes appear
     in both train and test.

Experiments:
  A) NIH Baseline      — ResNet-50 trained on NIH, evaluated on NIH test
  B) ChestX6 External  — NIH-trained model evaluated on corrected CX6 split
  C) DANN              — Domain adversarial training NIH↔CX6 (corrected splits)
  D) Random-Label Check — DANN retrained on shuffled labels → expect AUC ≈ 0.5

Outputs → results_final_study/corrected/
"""

